=== 13. USEFUL TIPS ===
Tab completion saves time
man cmd  or  cmd --help  before guessing
Never rm -rf /  or unquoted wildcards as root
history | grep something
cmd && next     # run next only if ok
cmd || fallback
> overwrite    >> append    | pipe
screen or tmux for long sessions
Keep system updated: apt update && apt upgrade
